    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Misha and Vitalik find themselves at the heart of a demonic invasion. No more streams or reviews\u2014just combat, fire, and sarcasm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each arena throws new challenges your way: hordes of hellish creatures, traps, strange buffs, and a touch of absurdity. It\u2019s not the strongest who survives, but the one who can crack a joke in the middle of chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the center of this madness stands the Patriarch\u2014a devious demon with an inflated ego and an army of loyal monsters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather upgrades, combine outrageous abilities, and brace yourself\u2014some of the weirdest and funniest moments in your gaming life are just ahead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722790/extras/54dd00807a5ac481222532d7b5df7c27.poster.avif?t=1749227532\" width=600 height=242 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722790/extras/54dd00807a5ac481222532d7b5df7c27.webm?t=1749227532\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722790/extras/54dd00807a5ac481222532d7b5df7c27.mp4?t=1749227532\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fast-paced runs</strong> \u2014 10\u201320 minute sessions packed with action and dark humor.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique bosses</strong> \u2014 each with distinct attacks, phases, and a nasty attitude.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story campaign</strong> \u2014 repel the demonic invasion and uncover the secrets of the Patriarch.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hero's lair</strong> \u2014 upgrade and personalize your base between runs: unlock rooms, decorations, and useful perks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlockable characters</strong> \u2014 each with a unique playstyle: sharpshooters, lucky types, or complete lunatics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gun madness</strong> \u2014 rifles, shotguns, flamethrowers, lasers, and even totally absurd weapons.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Killstreak system</strong> \u2014 rack up kills to call in air support: bombardments, drones, or a fiery carpet strike.</p></li></ul>",
