ragraph\" ><strong>Hero's lair</strong> \u2014 upgrade and personalize your base between runs: unlock rooms, decorations, and useful perks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlockable characters</strong> \u2014 each with a unique playstyle: sharpshooters, lucky types, or complete lunatics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gun madness</strong> \u2014 rifles, shotguns, flamethrowers, lasers, and even totally absurd weapons.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Killstreak system</strong> \u2014 rack up kills to call in air support: bombardments, drones, or a fiery carpet strike.</p></li></ul>",
